<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83785" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληθώρ-α</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληθώρ-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fullness,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀγορῆς,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγορὰ πλήθουσα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.173
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.223
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fullness, satiety,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπρηξίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.49
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				21
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κβ́.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Medic., <i>repletion of
				blood</i> or <i>humours, fullness of habit, plethora,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.891
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				2.10
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
